<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Jaqueline Souza — AI Evaluation &amp; Data Quality</title>
<meta name="description" content="Portfolio of Jaqueline Ribeiro de Souza: AI evaluation, audio and transcription QA, translation review, visual inspection and prompt refinement.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0f0f11">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;600;700&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#0f0f11;
  --bg-2:#141417;
  --card:#18181b;
  --card-2:#1e1e22;
  --line:rgba(226,210,178,.13);
  --line-2:rgba(226,210,178,.28);
  --gold:#cfb88e;
  --gold-hi:#ead9b0;
  --text:#f2eee5;
  --muted:#a29d92;
  --dim:#6f6b63;
  --pass:#93b8a0;
  --fail:#d58a77;
  --serif:"Cormorant Garamond","Iowan Old Style","Palatino Linotype",Georgia,serif;
  --sans:"Instrument Sans",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
  --wrap:1200px;
  --pad:clamp(20px,5vw,56px);
  --ease:cubic-bezier(.22,.7,.2,1);
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:84px;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{
  margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:var(--sans);
  font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden;
  background-image:radial-gradient(900px 600px at 88% -8%,rgba(207,184,142,.09),transparent 60%),
                   radial-gradient(700px 500px at -10% 40%,rgba(207,184,142,.04),transparent 60%);
  background-attachment:fixed;
}
img,svg{display:block;max-width:100%}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
button{font:inherit;color:inherit;cursor:pointer}
h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.005em}
p{margin:0}
ul{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gold-hi);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:4px}
.wrap{max-width:var(--wrap);margin:0 auto;padding-inline:var(--pad)}
.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}
.skip{position:absolute;left:-999px;top:8px;background:var(--gold);color:#111;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:6px;z-index:200}
.skip:focus{left:8px}

/* ---------- NAV ---------- */
.nav{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto 0;z-index:100;transition:background .4s var(--ease),border-color .4s var(--ease);border-bottom:1px solid transparent}
.nav.scrolled{background:rgba(15,15,17,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom-color:var(--line)}
.nav-in{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:72px}
.brand{font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.28em;font-weight:500;color:var(--text)}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:38px}
.nav-links a{font-size:.86rem;color:var(--muted);position:relative;padding:6px 0;transition:color .3s}
.nav-links a::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;height:1px;width:100%;background:var(--gold);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .4s var(--ease)}
.nav-links a:hover,.nav-links a.active{color:var(--text)}
.nav-links a:hover::after,.nav-links a.active::after{transform:scaleX(1)}
.burger{display:none;width:44px;height:44px;background:none;border:0;position:relative}
.burger span{position:absolute;left:11px;right:11px;height:1px;background:var(--text);transition:transform .4s var(--ease),top .4s var(--ease),opacity .3s}
.burger span:nth-child(1){top:18px}.burger span:nth-child(2){top:26px}
.burger[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(1){top:22px;transform:rotate(45deg)}
.burger[aria-expanded="true"] span:nth-child(2){top:22px;transform:rotate(-45deg)}
.mmenu{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:90;background:rgba(12,12,14,.97);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:0 var(--pad);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .4s var(--ease),visibility .4s}
.mmenu.open{opacity:1;visibility:visible}
.mmenu a{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:500;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline}
.mmenu a small{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.72rem;color:var(--dim);letter-spacing:.18em}

/* ---------- BUTTONS / BADGES / TAGS ---------- */
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line-2);font-size:.92rem;font-weight:500;transition:background .35s var(--ease),color .35s var(--ease),border-color .35s,transform .35s var(--ease)}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn-gold{background:var(--gold);color:#17140e;border-color:var(--gold)}
.btn-gold:hover{background:var(--gold-hi);border-color:var(--gold-hi)}
.btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold-hi)}
.btn[aria-disabled="true"]{opacity:.55}
.badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:600;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid var(--line-2);color:var(--gold-hi);white-space:nowrap}
.badge.pass{color:var(--pass);border-color:rgba(147,184,160,.45);background:rgba(147,184,160,.07)}
.badge.reject{color:var(--fail);border-color:rgba(213,138,119,.45);background:rgba(213,138,119,.07)}
.badge.pref{color:#17140e;background:var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold)}
.badge.soft{color:var(--muted);border-style:dashed}
.chip{display:inline-block;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.06em;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line-2);color:var(--gold-hi);background:rgba(207,184,142,.06);white-space:nowrap}
.chip.none{color:var(--dim);border-color:var(--line);background:none}

/* ---------- SECTION FRAME ---------- */
section{position:relative}
.sec{padding-block:clamp(84px,12vw,150px)}
.kicker{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;font-size:.74rem;letter-spacing:.24em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:26px}
.kicker::before{content:"";width:44px;height:1px;background:var(--gold)}
.h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4.6vw,3.7rem)}
.lead{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.06rem;max-width:62ch}

/* ---------- HERO ---------- */
.hero{min-height:100svh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding-top:110px}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.12fr .88fr;gap:clamp(24px,5vw,72px);align-items:center}
.hero .kicker{margin-bottom:30px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,6.1vw,5.3rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1.03}
.hero .sub{margin-top:30px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.1rem;max-width:56ch}
.hero-cta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin-top:40px}
.hero-art{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1/1;width:100%;max-width:540px;justify-self:end}
.hero-art svg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:visible}
#hWave,#hBounds,#hLabels{display:none}
.portrait{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:62%;aspect-ratio:1/1;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);margin:0;border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;background:var(--card);box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.55)}
.portrait img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 22%}
.portrait::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 60%,rgba(15,15,17,.55));pointer-events:none}
.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:28px;transform:translate(-50%,20px);z-index:400;background:var(--card-2);border:1px solid var(--gold);color:var(--gold-hi);padding:12px 22px;border-radius:999px;font-size:.88rem;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:all .4s var(--ease)}
.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}
.c-mail{margin-top:22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}
.c-mail a{color:var(--gold-hi);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-2)}
.ind{margin-top:clamp(48px,8vw,88px);border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr)}
.ind li{padding:22px 18px 22px 0;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);border-right:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:18px;transition:color .3s}
.ind li:first-child{padding-left:0}
.ind li:last-child{border-right:0}
.ind li:hover{color:var(--gold-hi)}

/* ---------- ABOUT ---------- */
.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(32px,6vw,96px);align-items:start}
.about-copy p{font-size:1.12rem;color:#d7d2c6;max-width:60ch}
.about-copy p+p{margin-top:22px;color:var(--muted)}
.langs{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--card);padding:34px}
.langs .row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.langs .row:first-child{padding-top:0}
.langs .row span:first-child{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.6rem}
.langs .row span:last-child{color:var(--gold);font-size:.85rem;letter-spacing:.14em}
.avail{margin-top:26px;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;color:var(--muted);font-size:.96rem}
.avail i{flex:none;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--pass);margin-top:9px;box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(147,184,160,.5);animation:pulse 2.6s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 9px rgba(147,184,160,0)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(147,184,160,0)}}

/* ---------- PROJECTS ---------- */
.projects-head{margin-bottom:56px}
.note{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;margin-top:34px;padding:16px 20px;border:1px dashed var(--line-2);border-radius:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;max-width:760px}
.note b{color:var(--gold-hi);font-weight:500;flex:none}
.project{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-block:clamp(64px,9vw,112px)}
.p-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;gap:clamp(18px,3vw,44px);align-items:start;margin-bottom:44px}
.p-num{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(3.4rem,7vw,6rem);line-height:.85;color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1px var(--gold);opacity:.85}
.p-title{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3.6vw,3rem)}
.p-sub{color:var(--gold);margin-top:12px;font-size:.95rem}
.p-desc{color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px;max-width:64ch}
.panel{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:clamp(20px,3vw,34px)}
.panel-t{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:18px;font-weight:500}
.grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}
.stack>*+*{margin-top:20px}
.sub-h{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,2.6vw,2.1rem);margin-bottom:8px}
.sub-p{color:var(--muted);max-width:66ch;margin-bottom:26px}
.blk{margin-top:64px}
.checks li{position:relative;padding:9px 0 9px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.95rem;color:#d7d2c6}
.checks li:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.checks li::before{content:"✓";position:absolute;left:0;top:9px;color:var(--gold)}
.checks.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;column-gap:34px}
.checks.two li:nth-last-child(2){border-bottom:0}

/* project 1 */
.ui-bar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:14px 22px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:0;border-radius:10px 10px 0 0;background:var(--card-2);font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted)}
.ui-bar b{color:var(--text);font-weight:500}
.prompt-box{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:26px clamp(20px,3vw,34px);background:var(--bg-2)}
.prompt-box .panel-t{margin-bottom:10px}
.prompt-box p{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(1.3rem,2.4vw,1.8rem);line-height:1.35}
.resp-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:0}
.resp{padding:clamp(20px,3vw,32px);background:var(--card);position:relative}
.resp+.resp{border-left:1px solid var(--line)}
.resp.is-pref{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(207,184,142,.07),var(--card) 55%)}
.resp.is-pref::before,.resp.is-rej::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;height:2px}
.resp.is-pref::before{background:var(--gold)}
.resp.is-rej::before{background:var(--fail);opacity:.7}
.resp-h{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:20px}
.resp-h h4{font-size:1.5rem}
.resp p{color:#d7d2c6;font-size:.98rem}
.resp mark{background:none;color:var(--fail);border-bottom:1px dotted var(--fail);cursor:help}
.resp .obs{margin-top:22px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.86rem;color:var(--muted)}
.resp .obs li{padding-left:16px;position:relative;margin-bottom:4px}
.resp .obs li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:.7em;width:6px;height:1px;background:var(--gold)}
.eval-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:0;border-radius:0 0 10px 10px;overflow:hidden}
.crit{padding:clamp(20px,3vw,32px);background:var(--card)}
.crit-tabs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:22px}
.crit-tabs button{padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line-2);background:none;font-size:.84rem;color:var(--muted);transition:all .3s var(--ease)}
.crit-tabs button:hover{color:var(--text);border-color:var(--gold)}
.crit-tabs button[aria-selected="true"]{background:var(--gold);color:#17140e;border-color:var(--gold)}
.crit-out{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
.crit-out div{padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:var(--bg-2);font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);min-height:132px}
.crit-out b{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-weight:500;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:8px;font-size:.84rem}
.crit-out .r{font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:600}
.r.p{color:var(--pass)}.r.f{color:var(--fail)}.r.m{color:var(--gold)}
.rationale{padding:clamp(20px,3vw,32px);background:var(--card-2);border-left:1px solid var(--line)}
.rationale p{color:#d7d2c6;font-size:.98rem}
.rationale p+p{margin-top:14px;color:var(--muted)}

/* project 2 */
.wf-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}
.wf{margin:0}
.wf-btn{display:block;width:100%;padding:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:var(--bg-2);overflow:hidden;position:relative;aspect-ratio:1570/177;transition:border-color .3s}
.wf-btn:hover{border-color:var(--gold)}
.wf-btn img{width:100%;height:auto;image-rendering:auto}
.wf-btn .zoom{position:absolute;right:10px;bottom:10px;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(15,15,17,.82);color:var(--gold-hi);opacity:0;transform:translateY(4px);transition:all .3s var(--ease)}
.wf-btn:hover .zoom,.wf-btn:focus-visible .zoom{opacity:1;transform:none}
.wf figcaption{margin-top:14px}
.wf figcaption b{display:block;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:600}
.wf figcaption span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}
.hint{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--dim);margin-top:14px}
.tbl-wrap{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--card)}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
th{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:500;color:var(--gold);text-align:left;padding:16px 20px;background:var(--card-2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-2)}
td{padding:18px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.96rem;vertical-align:top}
tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}
tbody tr{transition:background .3s}
tbody tr:hover{background:rgba(207,184,142,.045)}
.spk{font-size:.74rem;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}
.spk.s1{color:var(--gold-hi)}.spk.s2{color:#b9c6d6}
.ts{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}
.tx{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.35}
.tog{display:inline-flex;border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:999px;padding:3px;margin-bottom:22px}
.tog button{border:0;background:none;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:999px;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);transition:all .3s var(--ease)}
.tog button[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--gold);color:#17140e}
.ex-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}
.ex{padding:20px 22px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:var(--card)}
.ex .who{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}
.ex .q{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.4rem;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:14px;min-height:1.3em}
.ex .cleaned{color:var(--dim);text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-color:rgba(213,138,119,.6)}
.phen{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:22px}
.phen div{padding:16px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;background:var(--bg-2)}
.phen b{display:block;font-weight:500;font-size:.92rem;margin-bottom:4px}
.phen i{display:block;font-style:normal;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.08rem;color:var(--gold-hi);margin-bottom:6px}
.phen span{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;display:block}
.tl{padding:30px clamp(18px,3vw,34px) 26px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--card)}
.tl-ruler{position:relative;height:26px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-2);margin-left:96px}
.tl-ruler span{position:absolute;bottom:6px;transform:translateX(-50%);font-size:.7rem;color:var(--dim);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tl-ruler span:first-child{transform:none}
.lane{display:flex;align-items:center;height:64px;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line)}
.lane:last-of-type{border-bottom:0}
.lane-l{width:96px;flex:none;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:600}
.lane-t{position:relative;flex:1;height:100%}
.bar{position:absolute;top:16px;height:32px;border-radius:3px;display:flex;align-items:center;padding-left:10px;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#17140e;transform-origin:left;transition:transform .5s var(--ease),filter .3s}
.bar.a{background:var(--gold)}
.bar.b{background:#b9c6d6}
.bar:hover{filter:brightness(1.12);transform:scaleY(1.08)}
.bd{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:1px;background:rgba(226,210,178,.22);pointer-events:none}
.tl-body{margin-left:96px;position:relative}
.wf-flow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}
.wf-flow li{flex:1 1 130px;padding:20px 16px;text-align:center;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);border-right:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;background:var(--card);transition:background .3s,color .3s}
.wf-flow li:last-child{border-right:0}
.wf-flow li:hover{background:rgba(207,184,142,.08);color:var(--gold-hi)}
.wf-flow li small{display:block;font-size:.64rem;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:.1em}
.qa-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(207,184,142,.06),var(--card))}
.qa-card>div{padding:28px 24px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
.qa-card>div:last-child{border-right:0}
.qa-card h4{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.2em;font-weight:600;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:14px}
.qa-card .checks li{font-size:.9rem}

/* project 3 */
.tr-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}
.tr{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.tr-h{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:16px 24px;background:var(--card-2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600}
.tr-row{padding:20px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.tr-row:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.tr-row .lb{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
.tr-row .tx{font-size:1.4rem}
.tr-row.ok .lb em{color:var(--pass)}
.tr-row.bad .lb em{color:var(--fail)}
.tr-row.bad .tx{color:#c9bfae}
.tr-row.bad .tx s{text-decoration-color:var(--fail);text-decoration-thickness:1px}
.tr-row.fix .tx b{color:var(--gold-hi);font-weight:600}
.tr-why{padding:18px 24px;background:var(--bg-2);color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;flex:1}
.tr-row em{font-style:normal}
.tr-why b{color:var(--text);font-weight:500}
.crit-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}
.crit-cards li{padding:22px 16px;border-right:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);font-size:.86rem;transition:background .3s}
.crit-cards li:last-child{border-right:0}
.crit-cards li:hover{background:rgba(207,184,142,.06)}
.crit-cards b{display:block;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px}
.crit-cards span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.45;display:block}

/* project 4 */
.step{margin-top:72px}
.step-h{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:18px;margin-bottom:22px;padding-bottom:14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.step-h small{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}
.step-h h3{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,2.6vw,2.1rem)}
.big-prompt{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3.4vw,2.7rem);line-height:1.2;padding:clamp(28px,4vw,52px);border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(207,184,142,.08),transparent 60%),var(--card)}
.img-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}
.shot{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--card)}
.shot.win{border-color:rgba(147,184,160,.45)}
.shot.lose{border-color:rgba(213,138,119,.4)}
.shot-h{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.74rem;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:600}
.shot-img{position:relative;aspect-ratio:800/520;background:#222}
.shot-img>svg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}
.shot ul{padding:16px 18px 18px}
.shot li{font-size:.86rem;color:var(--muted);padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.shot li:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.shot li b{color:var(--text);font-weight:500;display:block;font-size:.78rem;margin-bottom:1px}
.gen-note{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--dim);margin-top:12px}
.cell-pass{color:var(--pass);font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap}
.cell-fail{color:var(--fail);font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap}
.dim-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:0;margin-top:20px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}
.dim-grid li{padding:16px 20px;font-size:.9rem;border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);color:#d7d2c6}
.dim-grid li:nth-child(3n){border-right:0}
.dim-grid li:nth-last-child(-n+3){border-bottom:0}
.dim-grid li::before{content:"✓";color:var(--gold);margin-right:10px}
.insp{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:start}
.insp-stage{position:relative;aspect-ratio:800/520;border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#222}
.insp-stage>svg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}
.insp-stage .grid-ov{background-image:linear-gradient(var(--line) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,var(--line) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:10% 10%;mix-blend-mode:screen;opacity:.5;pointer-events:none;position:absolute;inset:0}
.co{position:absolute;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;z-index:2}
.co i{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);color:#17140e;font-style:normal;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;display:grid;place-items:center;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(15,15,17,.55);transition:transform .3s var(--ease)}
.co span{position:absolute;left:34px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:.72rem;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(15,15,17,.88);border:1px solid var(--line-2);color:var(--gold-hi)}
.co.on i{transform:scale(1.28)}
.ov-ring{fill:none;stroke:var(--gold);stroke-width:2;stroke-dasharray:6 5;opacity:.35;transition:opacity .3s}
.ov-ring.on{opacity:1}
.defects li{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;padding:16px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);cursor:default;transition:background .3s}
.defects li:first-child{padding-top:4px}
.defects li:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.defects li:hover{background:rgba(207,184,142,.04)}
.defects b{font-weight:500;display:block}
.defects span.n{flex:none;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--gold);color:var(--gold);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;display:grid;place-items:center}
.defects em{font-style:normal;color:var(--muted);font-size:.86rem}
.decision{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);align-items:center;padding:clamp(24px,4vw,44px);border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(207,184,142,.09),transparent 65%),var(--card)}
.decision .verdict{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.4rem);line-height:1.1;margin-top:12px}
.decision .why{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(1.15rem,1.9vw,1.45rem);line-height:1.5;color:#d7d2c6}
.decision .why small{display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:600}
.pref-scale{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);margin-top:20px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}
.pref-scale li{padding:12px 6px;text-align:center;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--dim);border-right:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card)}
.pref-scale li:last-child{border-right:0}
.pref-scale li.sel{background:var(--gold);color:#17140e;font-weight:600}
.flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;gap:0 22px;align-items:stretch}
.flow-col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
.flow-mid{display:flex;align-items:center;color:var(--gold);font-size:1.6rem}
.fcard{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--card);padding:18px 20px}
.fcard .lb{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
.fcard p{font-size:.95rem;color:#d7d2c6}
.fcard .qt{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.4}
.fcard.img{padding:0;overflow:hidden}
.fcard.img .lb{padding:14px 20px 0}
.fcard.img .shot-img{margin-top:12px}
.fcard .issues{margin-top:10px;font-size:.84rem;color:var(--muted)}
.fcard .issues li{padding-left:16px;position:relative}
.fcard .issues li::before{content:"✕";position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--fail);font-size:.7rem;top:.15em}
.fcard .gains li::before{content:"✓";color:var(--pass)}
.arrow-down{display:none}
.chg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}
/* ---------- EXPERIENCE ---------- */
.exp-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:40px}
.exp-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--card);padding:20px 22px}
.exp-card .exp-h{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:6px}
.exp-card .exp-h b{font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)}
.exp-card .exp-h span{font-size:.7rem;color:var(--gold-hi);letter-spacing:.06em;white-space:nowrap}
.exp-card .role{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:8px}
.exp-card p{font-size:.86rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
@media(max-width:900px){.exp-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media(max-width:600px){.exp-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

.chg li{padding:20px 22px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:var(--card);font-size:.92rem;color:var(--muted)}
.chg li b{display:block;color:var(--text);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:4px}
.chg li b::before{content:"✓";color:var(--gold);margin-right:10px}
.pipeline{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:10px 8px;margin-top:40px;padding:26px;border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:12px;background:var(--card)}
.pipeline span{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:600;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid var(--line-2);color:var(--gold-hi)}
.pipeline i{font-style:normal;color:var(--dim);align-self:center}
.pipeline span:last-of-type{background:var(--gold);color:#17140e;border-color:var(--gold)}

/* ---------- SKILLS ---------- */
.skills-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:44px}
.skill{padding:14px 22px;border:1px solid var(--line-2);border-radius:999px;font-size:.95rem;color:#d7d2c6;background:var(--card);transition:all .35s var(--ease)}
.skill:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold-hi);transform:translateY(-3px);background:rgba(207,184,142,.07)}
.skill.lg{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.35rem;padding:16px 28px}

/* ---------- APPROACH ---------- */
.tline{position:relative;margin-top:56px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:0}
.tline::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:11px;height:1px;background:var(--line-2)}
.tl-i{position:relative;padding:44px 20px 0 0}
.tl-i::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:5px;width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--gold);transition:background .3s,transform .3s var(--ease)}
.tl-i:hover::before{background:var(--gold);transform:scale(1.25)}
.tl-i small{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600}
.tl-i h3{font-size:1.6rem;margin:6px 0 10px}
.tl-i p{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55}

/* ---------- CONTACT / FOOTER ---------- */
.contact{text-align:left;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.contact h2{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,7vw,6rem);font-weight:500;max-width:14ch}
.contact .lead{margin-top:26px}
.c-btns{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin-top:40px}
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:34px 0 44px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.86rem}
.f-in{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.f-in b{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--text);font-weight:600;display:block}

/* ---------- LIGHTBOX ---------- */
.lb-back{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:300;background:rgba(8,8,10,.97);display:flex;flex-direction:column;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .35s var(--ease),visibility .35s}
.lb-back.open{opacity:1;visibility:visible}
.lb-bar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:14px var(--pad);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.lb-bar b{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600}
.lb-bar small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem}
.lb-ctl{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.lb-ctl button{padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line-2);background:none;font-size:.8rem;transition:all .3s}
.lb-ctl button:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold-hi)}
.lb-stage{flex:1;overflow:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px var(--pad)}
.lb-stage img{width:100%;height:auto;max-width:none;background:#444;border:1px solid var(--line-2)}
.lb-stage.actual{justify-content:flex-start}
.lb-stage.actual img{width:auto;max-width:none}

/* ---------- REVEAL ---------- */
.rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px);transition:opacity .8s var(--ease),transform .8s var(--ease)}
.rv.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
.hero-art .draw{stroke-dasharray:var(--len);stroke-dashoffset:var(--len);animation:draw 2.6s var(--ease) .3s forwards}
@keyframes draw{to{stroke-dashoffset:0}}
.hero-art .fade{opacity:0;animation:fadein 1.2s var(--ease) 1.4s forwards}
@keyframes fadein{to{opacity:1}}
.hero-art .spin{transform-origin:270px 270px;animation:spin 80s linear infinite}
@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}

/* ---------- RESPONSIVE ---------- */
@media (max-width:1080px){
  .nav-links{gap:26px}
  .crit-cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
  .crit-cards li:nth-child(4){border-right:0}
  .crit-cards li:nth-child(-n+4){border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .qa-card{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .qa-card>div:nth-child(2){border-right:0}
  .qa-card>div:nth-child(-n+2){border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .tline{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);row-gap:40px}
  .tline::before{display:none}
  .phen{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
}
@media (max-width:900px){
  .nav-links{display:none}
  .burger{display:block}
  .hero-grid,.about-grid,.eval-grid,.insp{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .hero-art{max-width:380px;justify-self:center;order:-1;margin-bottom:8px}
  .hero{padding-top:96px}
  .ind{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .ind li{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .ind li:nth-child(2n){border-right:0}
  .ind li:nth-child(odd){padding-left:0}
  .ind li:nth-child(even){padding-left:18px}
  .rationale{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .p-head{grid-template-columns:auto 1fr}
  .p-head .badge{grid-column:1/-1;justify-self:start}
  .flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .flow-mid{display:none}
  .flow-col+.flow-mid+.flow-col{margin-top:0}
  .arrow-down{display:block;text-align:center;color:var(--gold);font-size:1.4rem;margin:12px 0}
  .chg{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .decision{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
@media (max-width:720px){
  .grid-2,.resp-grid,.wf-grid,.ex-list,.tr-grid,.img-pair,.crit-out,.checks.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .resp+.resp{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .checks.two li:nth-last-child(2){border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .qa-card{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .qa-card>div{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .qa-card>div:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .crit-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .crit-cards li{border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .crit-cards li:nth-child(2n){border-right:0}
  .crit-cards li:last-child{grid-column:1/-1;border-bottom:0;border-right:0}
  .tline{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .phen{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .dim-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .dim-grid li{border-right:1px solid var(--line)!important;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)!important}
  .dim-grid li:nth-child(2n){border-right:0!important}
  .dim-grid li:nth-last-child(-n+2){border-bottom:0!important}
  .chg{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .co span{display:none}
  .tl-ruler,.tl-body{margin-left:64px}
  .lane-l{width:64px;font-size:.62rem}
  .bar{font-size:.6rem;padding-left:6px}
  /* transcript table becomes stacked rows */
  .stack-tbl thead{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0)}
  .stack-tbl tr{display:block;padding:16px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .stack-tbl tr:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .stack-tbl td{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:5px 0;border:0}
  .stack-tbl td::before{content:attr(data-l);font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--dim);flex:none;padding-top:.45em}
  .stack-tbl td.tx{display:block}
  .stack-tbl td.tx::before{display:block;margin-bottom:2px}
  .wf-flow li{flex:1 1 45%;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
}
@media (max-width:480px){
  .mmenu a{font-size:2.1rem}
  .ind{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .ind li,.ind li:nth-child(even){padding-left:0;border-right:0}
  .tline{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .btn{padding:13px 22px}
  .pref-scale li{font-size:.6rem;padding:10px 2px}
  .ui-bar{padding:12px 16px}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  html{scroll-behavior:auto}
  *,*::before,*::after{animation-duration:.001ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important;transition-duration:.001ms!important}
  .rv{opacity:1;transform:none}
  .hero-art .draw{stroke-dashoffset:0}
  .hero-art .fade{opacity:1}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" data-scroll="projects" tabindex="0" role="link">Skip to projects</a>

<!-- NAV -->
<header class="nav" id="nav">
  <div class="wrap nav-in">
    <a data-scroll="home" class="brand" tabindex="0" role="link">JAQUELINE SOUZA</a>
    <nav aria-label="Main">
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a data-scroll="home" tabindex="0" role="link">Home</a>
        <a data-scroll="projects" tabindex="0" role="link">Projects</a>
        <a data-scroll="skills" tabindex="0" role="link">Skills</a>
        <a data-scroll="about" tabindex="0" role="link">About</a>
        <a data-scroll="experience" tabindex="0" role="link">Experience</a>
        <a data-scroll="contact" tabindex="0" role="link">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <button class="burger" id="burger" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mmenu"><span></span><span></span></button>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="mmenu" id="mmenu" aria-hidden="true">
  <a data-scroll="home" tabindex="0" role="link">Home <small>01</small></a>
  <a data-scroll="projects" tabindex="0" role="link">Projects <small>02</small></a>
  <a data-scroll="skills" tabindex="0" role="link">Skills <small>03</small></a>
  <a data-scroll="about" tabindex="0" role="link">About <small>04</small></a>
  <a data-scroll="experience" tabindex="0" role="link">Experience <small>05</small></a>
  <a data-scroll="contact" tabindex="0" role="link">Contact <small>06</small></a>
</div>

<main id="main">

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">AI EVALUATION · DATA QUALITY · MULTIMODAL QA</div>
        <h1>I evaluate AI outputs to help build better, more reliable data.</h1>
        <p class="sub">LLM evaluation, audio &amp; transcription QA, translation review, visual inspection and prompt refinement — with a focus on accuracy, consistency and human-centered quality.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a data-scroll="projects" class="btn btn-gold" tabindex="0" role="link">View Projects</a>
          <a data-scroll="contact" class="btn btn-ghost" tabindex="0" role="link">Contact Me</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-art" id="heroArt">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 540 540" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <g class="spin" id="hTicks" stroke="#cfb88e" stroke-opacity=".38"></g>
          <circle cx="270" cy="270" r="196" stroke="#cfb88e" stroke-opacity=".28"/>
          <circle cx="270" cy="270" r="150" stroke="#cfb88e" stroke-opacity=".14"/>
          <circle cx="270" cy="270" r="104" stroke="#cfb88e" stroke-opacity=".2" stroke-dasharray="2 6"/>
          <line x1="270" y1="40" x2="270" y2="500" stroke="#cfb88e" stroke-opacity=".08"/>
          <g id="hBounds" class="fade"></g>
          <path id="hWave" class="draw" stroke="#ead9b0" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <g id="hLabels" class="fade" font-family="Instrument Sans,sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#a29d92"></g>
        </svg>
        <figure class="portrait"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," width="720" height="900" alt="Portrait of Jaqueline Souza"></figure>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="ind">
      <li>LLM Evaluation</li>
      <li>Audio QA</li>
      <li>Translation QA</li>
      <li>Visual QA</li>
      <li>Prompt Refinement</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROJECTS -->
<section class="sec" id="projects" style="padding-bottom:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="projects-head rv">
      <div class="kicker">SELECTED DEMONSTRATIONS</div>
      <h2 class="h2">Projects &amp; Evaluation</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-top:20px">Practical demonstrations of how I evaluate AI-generated content across text, audio, language and images.</p>
      <div class="note"><b>Note</b><span>Portfolio demonstrations created to showcase my evaluation methodology. These examples are not presented as confidential client work.</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- PROJECT 01 -->
  <article class="project" id="project-1">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="p-head rv">
        <div class="p-num">01</div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="p-title">LLM Response Evaluation</h3>
          <p class="p-sub">Response Quality &amp; Instruction Following</p>
        </div>
        <span class="badge soft">PORTFOLIO DEMONSTRATION</span>
      </div>

      <div class="rv">
        <div class="ui-bar"><span><b>Side-by-side evaluation</b> · Response comparison</span><span>Choose the response that better follows the prompt</span></div>
        <div class="prompt-box">
          <div class="panel-t">PROMPT</div>
          <p>“Explain quantum computing to a 10-year-old using a soccer metaphor. No complex math.”</p>
        </div>
        <div class="resp-grid">
          <div class="resp is-rej">
            <div class="resp-h"><h4>Model A</h4><span class="badge reject">REJECTED</span></div>
            <p>Quantum computing uses quantum-mechanical phenomena, such as <mark title="Too technical for a 10-year-old">superposition and entanglement</mark>, to process information. Unlike classical bits, a qubit exists as a <mark title="Assumes linear algebra knowledge">linear combination of the |0⟩ and |1⟩ basis states</mark>, so algorithms like Shor's can achieve <mark title="Jargon; not explained">exponential speedups</mark>. It is a bit like a soccer match where the ball's position is probabilistic.</p>
            <ul class="obs">
              <li>Language is far too technical for the stated audience</li>
              <li>Level is not adapted to a child</li>
              <li>The soccer analogy is one incomplete sentence</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="resp is-pref">
            <div class="resp-h"><h4>Model B</h4><span class="badge pref">PREFERRED</span></div>
            <p>Think of a normal computer bit as a soccer ball that is either in the left goal or the right goal. A quantum bit is more like a ball spinning in the air: until it lands, it carries both possibilities. A quantum computer connects lots of these spinning balls so that, for some special puzzles, it can find answers much faster than checking one path at a time. It is not better at everything, but it can be great at certain very hard puzzles.</p>
            <ul class="obs">
              <li>One simple analogy carried through the whole answer</li>
              <li>Matches the requested level, with no complex math</li>
              <li>Clear, relevant and does not overclaim</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="eval-grid">
          <div class="crit">
            <div class="panel-t">EVALUATION CRITERIA</div>
            <div class="crit-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Evaluation criteria" id="critTabs"></div>
            <div class="crit-out" id="critOut" aria-live="polite"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="rationale">
            <div class="panel-t">DECISION RATIONALE</div>
            <p>Model B is preferred because it does what the prompt asks: a soccer metaphor, pitched at a 10-year-old, without complex math.</p>
            <p>Model A is not wrong, but it answers a different question. It is written for an adult reader and drops the metaphor after one line, so it fails the two constraints the prompt cared about most.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <!-- PROJECT 02 -->
  <article class="project" id="project-2">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="p-head rv">
        <div class="p-num">02</div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="p-title">Audio &amp; Transcription QA</h3>
          <p class="p-sub">Segmentation · Timestamps · Speaker Identification · Transcript Review</p>
          <p class="p-desc">Detailed review of spoken audio and transcripts, focusing on speaker identification, segmentation, speech boundaries, timing, and the accurate representation of natural speech.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="badge pass">QA PASS</span>
      </div>

      <!-- 2.1 waveform -->
      <div class="rv">
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px">
          <h4 class="sub-h" style="margin:0">Audio Segmentation &amp; Timing QA</h4>
          <span class="badge">VISUAL QA EXAMPLE</span>
        </div>
        <p class="sub-p" style="margin-top:10px">Two views of the same recording: the raw waveform first, then the segmented version reviewed for where speech starts, where it ends and whether every cut lands in the right place.</p>
        <div class="wf-grid">
          <figure class="wf">
            <button class="wf-btn" data-lb="0" aria-label="Enlarge: Original Audio Waveform"><img src="data:image/png;base64," width="1647" height="165" alt="Original audio waveform in blue on a dark grey background, showing bursts of speech separated by quiet gaps"><span class="zoom">CLICK TO ENLARGE</span></button>
            <figcaption><b>Original Audio Waveform</b><span>Raw waveform reviewed during speech and timing inspection.</span></figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="wf">
            <button class="wf-btn" data-lb="1" aria-label="Enlarge: Segmented Audio, QA Review"><img src="data:image/png;base64," width="1570" height="177" alt="Segmented audio waveform with highlighted regions and blue boundary markers separating speech segments"><span class="zoom">CLICK TO ENLARGE</span></button>
            <figcaption><b>Segmented Audio — QA Review</b><span>Audio segments reviewed for accurate speech boundaries, cuts, and timing.</span></figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">Tip: open either waveform to inspect it at full size.</p>
        <div class="panel" style="margin-top:26px">
          <div class="panel-t">WHAT I CHECK</div>
          <ul class="checks two">
            <li>Speech start and end points</li>
            <li>Segment boundaries</li>
            <li>Timing accuracy</li>
            <li>Missing speech</li>
            <li>Incorrect cuts</li>
            <li>Segment alignment</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2.2 transcript -->
      <div class="blk rv">
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px">
          <h4 class="sub-h" style="margin:0">Speaker Identification &amp; Transcription</h4>
          <span class="badge soft">PORTFOLIO DEMONSTRATION</span>
        </div>
        <p class="sub-p" style="margin-top:10px">A short multi-speaker exchange, transcribed and segmented. Note that Speaker 2's hesitation is kept and tagged rather than removed.</p>
        <div class="tbl-wrap">
          <table class="stack-tbl">
            <thead><tr><th>SPEAKER</th><th>TIMESTAMP</th><th>TRANSCRIPTION</th><th>SPEECH TAGS</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td data-l="SPEAKER"><span class="spk s1">SPEAKER 1</span></td><td data-l="TIMESTAMP" class="ts">00:00–00:03</td><td class="tx" data-l="TRANSCRIPTION">“Hey, did you finish the report?”</td><td data-l="TAGS"><span class="chip none">—</span></td></tr>
              <tr><td data-l="SPEAKER"><span class="spk s2">SPEAKER 2</span></td><td data-l="TIMESTAMP" class="ts">00:03–00:07</td><td class="tx" data-l="TRANSCRIPTION">“Uh, almost. I just need to check one more thing.”</td><td data-l="TAGS"><span class="chip">FILLER</span></td></tr>
              <tr><td data-l="SPEAKER"><span class="spk s1">SPEAKER 1</span></td><td data-l="TIMESTAMP" class="ts">00:07–00:09</td><td class="tx" data-l="TRANSCRIPTION">“Okay, no problem.”</td><td data-l="TAGS"><span class="chip none">—</span></td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2.3 phenomena -->
      <div class="blk rv">
        <h4 class="sub-h">Speech Phenomena &amp; Annotation</h4>
        <p class="sub-p">Transcription QA may require preserving relevant characteristics of natural human speech instead of silently cleaning them up. Whether and how each one is tagged depends on the project guidelines. These are portfolio demonstrations of the kinds of phenomena that can be reviewed and annotated.</p>
        <div class="tog" role="group" aria-label="Transcript view">
          <button type="button" id="tgKeep" aria-pressed="true">Speech preserved</button>
          <button type="button" id="tgClean" aria-pressed="false">Silently cleaned up</button>
        </div>
        <div class="ex-list" id="exList"></div>
        <div class="phen">
          <div><i>the the report</i><b>Repetition</b><span>Repeated words kept as spoken.</span></div>
          <div><i>I-I-I think</i><b>Stuttering / hesitation</b><span>Sound or word repeated while starting a phrase.</span></div>
          <div><i>um, uh</i><b>Filler words</b><span>Sounds that fill space without adding meaning.</span></div>
          <div><i>I was going to— actually</i><b>False starts</b><span>A sentence is abandoned and restarted.</span></div>
          <div><i>we should sched- schedule</i><b>Word fragments</b><span>A word cut off before it is completed.</span></div>
          <div><i>Wait, I—</i><b>Interrupted speech</b><span>Speech that stops because another speaker cuts in.</span></div>
          <div><i>[long pause]</i><b>Long pauses</b><span>Silence long enough to change the flow of the exchange.</span></div>
          <div><i>[overlap]</i><b>Overlapping speech</b><span>Two speakers talking at the same time.</span></div>
          <div><i>[unclear]</i><b>Unclear speech</b><span>Words that cannot be understood with confidence.</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2.4 speaker segmentation -->
      <div class="blk rv">
        <h4 class="sub-h">Speaker Segmentation</h4>
        <p class="sub-p">An illustrative timeline of two speakers. Each segment has to belong to the right person, start on the right timestamp and leave the words on either side intact.</p>
        <div class="tl">
          <div class="tl-ruler" aria-hidden="true">
            <span style="left:0">00:00</span><span style="left:25%">00:03</span><span style="left:58.33%">00:07</span><span style="left:75%">00:09</span><span style="left:100%">00:12</span>
          </div>
          <div class="lane"><div class="lane-l spk s1">SPEAKER 1</div><div class="lane-t">
            <div class="bar a" style="left:0;width:25%" title="00:00–00:03">S1</div>
            <div class="bar a" style="left:58.33%;width:16.67%" title="00:07–00:09">S1</div>
            <div class="bd" style="left:25%"></div><div class="bd" style="left:58.33%"></div><div class="bd" style="left:75%"></div>
          </div></div>
          <div class="lane"><div class="lane-l spk s2">SPEAKER 2</div><div class="lane-t">
            <div class="bar b" style="left:25%;width:33.33%" title="00:03–00:07">S2</div>
            <div class="bar b" style="left:75%;width:25%" title="00:09–00:12">S2</div>
            <div class="bd" style="left:25%"></div><div class="bd" style="left:58.33%"></div><div class="bd" style="left:75%"></div>
          </div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel" style="margin-top:20px">
          <div class="panel-t">QA CHECKS ON EVERY SEGMENT</div>
          <ul class="checks two">
            <li>Each segment is assigned to the correct speaker</li>
            <li>Speaker changes occur at the correct timestamp</li>
            <li>No speech is accidentally assigned to another speaker</li>
            <li>Speech is not missing between segments</li>
            <li>Segment boundaries do not unnecessarily cut words</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2.5 checklist -->
      <div class="blk rv">
        <h4 class="sub-h">QA Checklist</h4>
        <p class="sub-p">The checklist I run against audio and transcript before a file is marked as reviewed.</p>
        <div class="qa-card">
          <div><h4>AUDIO QUALITY</h4><ul class="checks"><li>Speech is audible</li><li>No relevant speech is missing</li><li>Audio boundaries are accurate</li></ul></div>
          <div><h4>TRANSCRIPTION</h4><ul class="checks"><li>Words match the audio</li><li>Speaker labels are correct</li><li>Natural speech is preserved</li><li>Repetitions and stutters are handled consistently</li><li>Fillers and hesitations are correctly identified</li></ul></div>
          <div><h4>SEGMENTATION</h4><ul class="checks"><li>Start/end timestamps are accurate</li><li>Speaker changes are correctly segmented</li><li>No overlapping or incorrectly split segments</li></ul></div>
          <div><h4>QUALITY CONTROL</h4><ul class="checks"><li>Audio and transcript are aligned</li><li>Issues are documented</li><li>Corrections are applied consistently</li></ul></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2.6 workflow -->
      <div class="blk rv">
        <h4 class="sub-h">QA Workflow</h4>
        <ol class="wf-flow" style="padding:0;margin:26px 0 0;list-style:none">
          <li><small>01</small>LISTEN</li>
          <li><small>02</small>SEGMENT</li>
          <li><small>03</small>IDENTIFY SPEAKER</li>
          <li><small>04</small>TRANSCRIBE</li>
          <li><small>05</small>TAG SPEECH PHENOMENA</li>
          <li><small>06</small>QA</li>
          <li><small>07</small>CORRECT</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
  <!-- PROJECT 03 -->
  <article class="project" id="project-3">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="p-head rv">
        <div class="p-num">03</div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="p-title">Translation &amp; Linguistic QA</h3>
          <p class="p-sub">English ↔ Brazilian Portuguese</p>
          <p class="p-desc">Translation review goes beyond checking whether the words match. I look at whether the meaning survives, whether the wording is natural and whether it sounds like something a native speaker would actually say.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="badge soft">PORTFOLIO DEMONSTRATION</span>
      </div>

      <div class="tr-grid rv">
        <div class="tr">
          <div class="tr-h"><span>PT → EN</span><span class="badge reject">CORRECTION</span></div>
          <div class="tr-row"><div class="lb"><span>SOURCE · PT-BR</span></div><div class="tx">“A reunião foi adiada para amanhã.”</div></div>
          <div class="tr-row bad"><div class="lb"><span>PROBLEMATIC</span><em>✕ UNNATURAL</em></div><div class="tx">“The meeting was <s>delayed for</s> tomorrow.”</div></div>
          <div class="tr-row ok fix"><div class="lb"><span>CORRECT</span><em>✓ ACCEPTED</em></div><div class="tx">“The meeting was <b>postponed until</b> tomorrow.”</div></div>
          <div class="tr-why"><b>Why it changes:</b> “Delayed” suggests something ran late or slower than planned, while “adiada” means the meeting was moved to a later time. “Delayed for tomorrow” is also a word-for-word carry-over of “para amanhã”; English uses “until” or “to” here. “Postponed until tomorrow” keeps both the meaning and the natural phrasing.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tr">
          <div class="tr-h"><span>EN → PT-BR</span><span class="badge pass">APPROVED</span></div>
          <div class="tr-row"><div class="lb"><span>SOURCE · EN</span></div><div class="tx">“Please review the document before submitting it.”</div></div>
          <div class="tr-row ok fix"><div class="lb"><span>CORRECT</span><em>✓ ACCEPTED</em></div><div class="tx">“Por favor, <b>revise</b> o documento antes de <b>enviá-lo</b>.”</div></div>
          <div class="tr-why"><b>Why it works:</b> The polite imperative “revise” matches the courteous tone of “Please”, and “enviá-lo” is correct written Brazilian Portuguese. In an informal setting, “antes de enviar” would also be natural, so register is checked against the context of the text.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="blk rv" style="margin-top:44px">
        <div class="panel-t">CRITERIA I REVIEW AGAINST</div>
        <ul class="crit-cards">
          <li><b>Meaning</b><span>Nothing added, lost or distorted</span></li>
          <li><b>Grammar</b><span>Agreement, tense, punctuation</span></li>
          <li><b>Terminology</b><span>Correct and consistent terms</span></li>
          <li><b>Tone</b><span>Register fits the source</span></li>
          <li><b>Fluency</b><span>Reads smoothly, no friction</span></li>
          <li><b>Naturalness</b><span>Sounds like a native speaker</span></li>
          <li><b>Brazilian Portuguese</b><span>PT-BR usage, not European</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <!-- PROJECT 04 -->
  <article class="project" id="project-4">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="p-head rv">
        <div class="p-num">04</div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="p-title">AI Image Evaluation &amp; Prompt Refinement</h3>
          <p class="p-sub">Generate → Compare → Detect → Explain → Refine</p>
          <p class="p-desc">One prompt, two generated images. I compare them, locate the defects, document the decision and then rewrite the prompt so the next output is better.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="badge soft">PORTFOLIO DEMONSTRATION</span>
      </div>

      <!-- step 1 -->
      <div class="step rv" style="margin-top:0">
        <div class="step-h"><small>STEP 01</small><h3>Prompt</h3></div>
        <div class="big-prompt">“Generate a realistic sailboat sailing on calm ocean water.”</div>
      </div>

      <!-- step 2 -->
      <div class="step rv">
        <div class="step-h"><small>STEP 02</small><h3>Image A vs Image B</h3></div>
        <div class="img-pair">
          <div class="shot win">
            <div class="shot-h"><span>IMAGE A · ACCEPTABLE</span><span class="badge pref">PREFERRED</span></div>
            <div class="shot-img"><svg viewBox="0 0 800 520" role="img" aria-label="Image A: a well-formed sailboat on calm water with a straight mast, proportional hull and coherent sails"><use href="#sceneA" width="800" height="520"/></svg></div>
            <ul>
              <li><b>Instruction following</b>Highly aligned: a realistic sailboat on calm ocean water.</li>
              <li><b>Visual quality</b>No serious artifacts; light and shadow sit naturally on the water.</li>
              <li><b>Structural integrity</b>Hull, mast and sails are plausible and correctly proportioned.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="shot lose">
            <div class="shot-h"><span>IMAGE B · DEFECTIVE</span><span class="badge reject">REJECTED</span></div>
            <div class="shot-img"><svg viewBox="0 0 800 520" role="img" aria-label="Image B: a sailboat with a warped hull, tilted mast, distorted sails and an unstable horizon"><use href="#sceneB" width="800" height="520"/></svg></div>
            <ul>
              <li><b>Instruction following</b>Partly aligned: a sailboat on water, but distorted sails and an unstable horizon weaken “realistic” and “calm”.</li>
              <li><b>Visual quality</b>Excess grain and uneven lighting across the frame.</li>
              <li><b>Structural integrity</b>Visible deformation of the hull and mast.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="gen-note">Both images are illustrations created for this demonstration to show the kind of difference I evaluate. They are not outputs from a specific model.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- step 3 -->
      <div class="step rv">
        <div class="step-h"><small>STEP 03</small><h3>Visual QA</h3></div>
        <div class="tbl-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead><tr><th>CRITERIA</th><th>IMAGE A</th><th>IMAGE B</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>Prompt adherence</td><td class="cell-pass">✓ Pass</td><td class="cell-pass">✓ Pass</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Object structure</td><td class="cell-pass">✓ Pass</td><td class="cell-fail">✕ Defect</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Proportions</td><td class="cell-pass">✓ Pass</td><td class="cell-fail">✕ Defect</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Visual coherence</td><td class="cell-pass">✓ Pass</td><td class="cell-fail">✕ Defect</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Artifacts</td><td class="cell-pass">✓ Pass</td><td class="cell-fail">✕ Defect</td></tr>
              <tr><td><b>Overall quality</b></td><td><span class="badge pass">PASS</span></td><td><span class="badge reject">REJECT</span></td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-t" style="margin-top:34px">EVALUATION DIMENSIONS</div>
        <ul class="dim-grid">
          <li>Generation instruction following</li>
          <li>Structural integrity</li>
          <li>Visual quality</li>
          <li>Style alignment</li>
          <li>Preservation of unedited areas</li>
          <li>Overall usability &amp; satisfaction</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- step 4 -->
      <div class="step rv">
        <div class="step-h"><small>STEP 04</small><h3>Defect detection</h3></div>
        <div class="insp">
          <div class="insp-stage" id="inspStage">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 800 520" role="img" aria-label="Image B with three numbered defect markers: deformed hull, misaligned mast and inconsistent proportions"><use href="#sceneB" width="800" height="520"/>
              <ellipse class="ov-ring" data-d="1" cx="418" cy="392" rx="212" ry="52"/>
              <ellipse class="ov-ring" data-d="2" cx="410" cy="268" rx="24" ry="122" transform="rotate(22 410 268)"/>
              <ellipse class="ov-ring" data-d="3" cx="540" cy="234" rx="94" ry="132"/>
            </svg>
            <div class="grid-ov"></div>
            <div class="co" data-d="1" style="left:37.5%;top:78%"><i>1</i><span>Deformed hull</span></div>
            <div class="co" data-d="2" style="left:51.2%;top:52%"><i>2</i><span>Misaligned mast</span></div>
            <div class="co l" data-d="3" style="left:68%;top:33%"><i>3</i><span style="left:auto;right:34px">Inconsistent proportions</span></div>
          </div>
          <ul class="defects panel" style="padding:24px 26px">
            <li data-d="1"><span class="n">01</span><div><b>Deformed hull</b><em>The hull is warped and the deck line dips and bulges instead of running straight.</em></div></li>
            <li data-d="2"><span class="n">02</span><div><b>Misaligned mast</b><em>The mast leans sharply and does not sit on the hull's centreline; a faint duplicate is visible behind it.</em></div></li>
            <li data-d="3"><span class="n">03</span><div><b>Inconsistent proportions</b><em>The mainsail is oversized for the mast and floats above it, while the jib looks melted.</em></div></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">Hover a defect to highlight it on the image.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- step 5 -->
      <div class="step rv">
        <div class="step-h"><small>STEP 05</small><h3>QA decision</h3></div>
        <div class="decision">
          <div>
            <span class="badge pref">IMAGE A · ACCEPTABLE</span>
            <div class="verdict">Image A is the better result.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="why"><small>REASON</small>“Image A presents a coherent boat structure with natural proportions and no major visible defects. Image B contains structural deformation that affects visual quality and object consistency.”
            <ul class="pref-scale" aria-label="Preference scale, Left Much Better selected">
              <li class="sel">Left much better</li><li>Left slightly better</li><li>Same</li><li>Right slightly better</li><li>Right much better</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- step 6 -->
      <div class="step rv">
        <div class="step-h"><small>STEP 06</small><h3>Prompt refinement</h3></div>
        <div class="flow">
          <div class="flow-col">
            <div class="fcard"><div class="lb"><span>PROMPT V1</span></div><p class="qt">“Create a boat.”</p></div>
            <div class="fcard img"><div class="lb"><span>OUTPUT V1</span><span class="chip none">GENERIC</span></div>
              <div class="shot-img"><svg viewBox="0 0 800 520" role="img" aria-label="Output V1: a plain generic boat on a flat background"><use href="#sceneV1" width="800" height="520"/></svg></div>
              <div style="padding:14px 20px 18px"><ul class="issues"><li>Insufficient detail</li><li>Ambiguous subject</li><li>Generic composition</li></ul></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flow-mid" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
          <div class="arrow-down" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
          <div class="flow-col">
            <div class="fcard"><div class="lb"><span>PROMPT V2</span></div><p class="qt" style="font-size:1.05rem">“Generate a realistic wooden fishing boat sailing on calm ocean water, with natural proportions, a straight symmetrical hull, correctly aligned mast, golden-hour lighting and a slightly elevated camera perspective. Avoid warped, duplicated or distorted structures.”</p></div>
            <div class="fcard img"><div class="lb"><span>OUTPUT V2</span><span class="chip">SPECIFIC</span></div>
              <div class="shot-img"><svg viewBox="0 0 800 520" role="img" aria-label="Output V2: a wooden fishing boat with a symmetrical hull and straight mast on calm water at golden hour"><use href="#sceneV2" width="800" height="520"/></svg></div>
              <div style="padding:14px 20px 18px"><ul class="issues gains"><li>Clear subject and setting</li><li>Structure and lighting specified</li><li>Distortions explicitly excluded</li></ul></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- step 7 -->
      <div class="step rv">
        <div class="step-h"><small>STEP 07</small><h3>What changed?</h3></div>
        <ul class="chg">
          <li><b>Subject type</b>“A boat” became a wooden fishing boat.</li>
          <li><b>Environment</b>Calm ocean water is stated explicitly.</li>
          <li><b>Structural constraints</b>Straight symmetrical hull, aligned mast.</li>
          <li><b>Lighting</b>Golden-hour light replaces unspecified light.</li>
          <li><b>Camera perspective</b>A slightly elevated viewpoint is defined.</li>
          <li><b>Visual quality requirements</b>Warped, duplicated or distorted structures are ruled out.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="pipeline" aria-label="Evaluation pipeline">
          <span>PROMPT</span><i>→</i><span>OUTPUT</span><i>→</i><span>QA</span><i>→</i><span>DEFECT</span><i>→</i><span>DECISION</span><i>→</i><span>REFINEMENT</span><i>→</i><span>IMPROVED OUTPUT</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>

<!-- SKILLS -->
