        <h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom:30px">About My Work</h2>
        <p>I work across AI evaluation, data annotation and quality assurance, reviewing text, audio, translation and visual outputs with a strong focus on accuracy, consistency and instruction following.</p>
        <p>My work involves comparing AI responses, identifying errors and inconsistencies, reviewing transcription and segmentation, checking translation quality, inspecting generated images for visual defects, and refining prompts when outputs do not meet the intended requirements.</p>
